.settings-modal.hidden
    .settings-modal__content
        .settings-modal__top
            .settings-modal__title
                span.settings-modal__title-text Configuración
            .button.settings-modal__close-button(role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Cerrar")
                svg( xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x-icon lucide-x")
                    path( d="M18 6 6 18")
                    path( d="m6 6 12 12")
        .settings-modal__bottom
            .settings-modal__intro
            .settings-modal__muted-note.hidden
                | El sonido está apagado. Usá el botón del parlante para volver a activarlo.
            .settings-modal__settings
                .settings-modal__setting
                    label.settings-modal__setting-label(for="settings-volume-music") Música
                    input.settings-modal__slider#settings-volume-music(type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="100" data-audio-category="music")
                    span.settings-modal__setting-value 100%
                .settings-modal__setting
                    label.settings-modal__setting-label(for="settings-volume-sfx") Efectos
                    input.settings-modal__slider#settings-volume-sfx(type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="100" data-audio-category="sfx")
                    span.settings-modal__setting-value 100%
                .settings-modal__setting
                    label.settings-modal__setting-label(for="settings-volume-keys") Teclado
                    input.settings-modal__slider#settings-volume-keys(type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="100" data-audio-category="keys")
                    span.settings-modal__setting-value 100%
            .settings-modal__keypacks-section
                span.settings-modal__keypacks-title Sonido del teclado
                .settings-modal__keypacks(role="radiogroup" aria-label="Sonido del teclado")
            .settings-modal__rules-section
                span.settings-modal__rules-title Reglas
                button.settings-modal__toggle(type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="false" aria-describedby="settings-strict-accents-hint")
                    span.settings-modal__toggle-text
                        span.settings-modal__toggle-label Tildes y ñ obligatorias
                        span.settings-modal__toggle-hint#settings-strict-accents-hint Si está activado, hay que escribir cada letra con su tilde o ñ.
                    span.settings-modal__toggle-switch(aria-hidden="true")
            .settings-modal__credits
                span.settings-modal__credits-title Créditos
                .settings-modal__credits-body
                    p.settings-modal__credit Gianni Ballerini - Desarrollo y diseño
                    p.settings-modal__credit
                        | Música de
                        a(href="https://suno.com/s/whBosC7fZmrghfbQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer") Suno AI
                    p.settings-modal__credit
                        | Efectos de sonido de
                        a(href="https://mechvibes.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer") Mechvibes
